===Noun===
{{en-noun|hypodermes|es}}

# An [[epidermal]] layer of cells that secretes an overlying chitinous [[cuticle]], as in [[arthropod]]s.
# {{lb|en|botany}} A layer of cells lying immediately below the [[epidermis]].
# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A [[subcutaneous]] layer of loose connective tissue containing fat cells, lying beneath the [[dermis]].

